---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro"; import PageHero from "../components/PageHero.astro"; import CTA from "../components/CTA.astro";
---
<BaseLayout title="Resources for Independent Authors" description="The Author Vista editorial resource centre is being prepared to answer practical questions about manuscripts, editing, design and self publishing.">
  <PageHero eyebrow="Resources" title="Useful publishing knowledge, without the sales fog." intro="This resource centre is reserved for evidence based guidance that helps authors make better writing, editing, design and publishing decisions." />
  <section class="section"><div class="shell split"><div><p class="eyebrow">Editorial roadmap</p><h2>Content will be published when it is ready to deserve attention.</h2></div><div class="prose"><p>Planned topics include choosing the right level of editing, preparing a manuscript for formatting, comparing self publishing platform roles, understanding metadata and building a realistic book launch plan.</p><p class="notice">No articles are presented as published yet. Educational content will include a visible author or reviewer, publication date, meaningful update date and sources where factual claims require evidence.</p></div></div></section>
  <section class="section surface-forest"><div class="shell manifesto-grid"><div class="service-motif motif-layout" aria-hidden="true"><span></span><i></i><i></i><i></i><b>?</b></div><div data-sequence><p class="eyebrow light" data-sequence-item>Read for a reason</p><h2 data-sequence-item>Answers grounded in the decisions authors actually face.</h2><div class="prose prose-light" data-sequence-item><p>What kind of editing does this draft need? Which files belong to which format? What remains under the author’s control? Each resource will begin with a practical question and answer it without inflated promises.</p></div></div></div></section>
  <section class="section surface-ivory"><div class="shell"><p class="eyebrow">First topic clusters</p><div class="principles"><div class="principle"><h3>Manuscript development</h3><p>Structure, writing routes, evaluation and editorial readiness.</p></div><div class="principle"><h3>Editing decisions</h3><p>Developmental editing, line editing, copyediting and proofreading.</p></div><div class="principle"><h3>Publishing control</h3><p>Accounts, ISBN considerations, metadata and platform responsibilities.</p></div><div class="principle"><h3>Book presentation</h3><p>Cover design, interiors, ebooks, illustration and production files.</p></div></div></div></section>
  <CTA title="Have a question about your own manuscript?" text="An introductory call can clarify the project stage and whether Author Vista may be a suitable publishing services partner." />
</BaseLayout>
